Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:48.37,Note,,0,0,0,,《第一滴血5：最后的血》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:01.48,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:48.91,Note,,0,0,0,,这音乐真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:51.15,Note,,0,0,0,,要是让她妈妈听到...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.15,0:06:52.51,Note,,0,0,0,,你喜欢这音乐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:15.10,Note,,0,0,0,,他从来都不希望你靠近那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.41,Note,,0,0,0,,谁在乎原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:20.69,Note,,0,0,0,,那男人就是行尸走肉 他没有心 没有灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.90,Note,,0,0,0,,她还跟吉赛尔有联系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:50.95,Note,,0,0,0,,吉赛尔不是什么好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.07,Note,,0,0,0,,- 她已经变了 - 不 她没变
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:55.56,Note,,0,0,0,,她当初走了我可高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:58.75,Note,,0,0,0,,他根本不会记得你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:12:01.93,Note,,0,0,0,,他从来就没有个当父亲的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:16.82,Note,,0,0,0,,他根本不配见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:20.64,Note,,0,0,0,,你妈得癌症快病死的时候  他一次都没去过医院
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:25.46,Note,,0,0,0,,有一次圣诞节他用皮带抽你妈妈  约翰连拉带拽才把他拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:31.45,Note,,0,0,0,,我不希望你靠近那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:35.87,Note,,0,0,0,,我们不会让你去危险的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:37.41,Note,,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:44.90,Note,,0,0,0,,(墨西哥)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:30.35,Note,,0,0,0,,(玛雅罗恩街)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:03.57,Note,,0,0,0,,你真美 姐妹儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.70,Note,,0,0,0,,时间长了点 但没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:08.33,Note,,0,0,0,,你还是处女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:11.96,Note,,0,0,0,,别紧张 我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:14.88,Note,,0,0,0,,瞧你这一身尘土 肯定渴了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:13.32,Note,,0,0,0,,等我喝完这瓶 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:49.74,Note,,0,0,0,,- 曼纽尔在吗 - 你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:53.20,Note,,0,0,0,,我只想跟他说几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.58,Note,,0,0,0,,- 你想干什么 - 你在跟谁说话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:05.67,Note,,0,0,0,,- 她是谁 - 我回头解释
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:12.76,Note,,0,0,0,,我没有你的手机号码
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:19.26,Note,,0,0,0,,把她带回我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.64,0:24:12.69,Note,,0,0,0,,事实是...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.69,0:24:14.77,Note,,0,0,0,,我喜欢狗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.40,0:24:18.65,Note,,0,0,0,,但如果它们敢逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.11,0:24:22.61,Note,,0,0,0,,我就会生气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:29.37,Note,,0,0,0,,它就得受到惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.37,0:24:33.17,Note,,0,0,0,,我能说什么呢 那会让我不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.54,0:24:37.42,Note,,0,0,0,,如果你们哪个小婊子想逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:40.76,Note,,0,0,0,,尽管试试 跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.26,0:24:46.60,Note,,0,0,0,,但我会找到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:52.81,Note,,0,0,0,,而且我会杀了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.81,0:24:55.44,Note,,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:33.70,Note,,0,0,0,,你是谁 你想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.81,0:29:00.73,Note,,0,0,0,,(乡村夜店)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.90,0:31:56.28,Note,,0,0,0,,滚
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.82,0:32:04.20,Note,,0,0,0,,她在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.78,0:32:06.95,Note,,0,0,0,,我不认识这个贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.58,0:33:32.41,Note,,0,0,0,,姑娘们 老实点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.41,0:33:37.13,Note,,0,0,0,,没日没夜地接客就好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.38,0:33:40.05,Note,,0,0,0,,甭管是四十个还是五十个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.71,0:33:43.55,Note,,0,0,0,,没有命令不许停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.47,0:33:46.64,Note,,0,0,0,,老实点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.81,0:33:52.27,Note,,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.69,0:33:56.10,Note,,0,0,0,,哪所房子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:34:00.57,Note,,0,0,0,,顶层那所
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.57,0:34:02.36,Note,,0,0,0,,亮着灯的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.06,0:36:39.23,Note,,0,0,0,,刀不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:45.31,Note,,0,0,0,,你来这做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.07,0:36:50.11,Note,,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗 老头
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.24,0:36:53.74,Note,,0,0,0,,不说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.12,0:36:58.04,Note,,0,0,0,,那我用这把刀把你的嘴划开如何
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.04,0:37:06.00,Note,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.84,0:37:09.63,Note,,0,0,0,,你们那的妓女不够使了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.80,0:37:13.47,Note,,0,0,0,,我认识这个妞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.35,0:37:17.68,Note,,0,0,0,,这婊子在我们这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:40.91,Note,,0,0,0,,她是你的什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.26,0:38:01.89,Note,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.90,0:38:07.52,Note,,0,0,0,,把他扶起来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.74,0:38:25.21,Note,,0,0,0,,把他扔到酸里...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.43,0:39:30.44,Note,,0,0,0,,- 你他妈说什么呢 - 别插嘴 维克多 操
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.96,0:39:53.63,Note,,0,0,0,,在他和他的小婊子脸上留下你的记号
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.21,0:39:56.96,Note,,0,0,0,,深一点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.66,0:41:51.25,Note,,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.66,0:41:54.37,Note,,0,0,0,,你们从哪拿到的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.13,0:42:01.84,Note,,0,0,0,,他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.51,0:42:07.47,Note,,0,0,0,,现在都不重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.01,0:42:12.81,Note,,0,0,0,,他正躺在外面的大街上
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.85,0:42:15.28,Note,,0,0,0,,脸上留下了我的记号
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.72,0:42:50.80,Note,,0,0,0,,如果他静养 应该可以愈合
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.01,0:42:54.56,Note,,0,0,0,,他有严重的脑震荡 应该送往医院
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.80,0:42:56.85,Note,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.31,0:42:58.77,Note,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.19,0:43:09.53,Note,,0,0,0,,因为脑震荡 他对噪声和光线都很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.53,0:43:13.45,Note,,0,0,0,,过几天应该就能好起来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.13,0:43:18.39,Note,,0,0,0,,卡门 你知道我关心你 但这件事太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.44,0:43:21.75,Note,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.66,0:45:45.97,Note,,0,0,0,,(维克多·马丁内斯 雨果·马丁内斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.29,0:47:28.56,Note,,0,0,0,,- 你想要什么 - 姑娘 有年轻的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.54,0:48:03.72,Note,,0,0,0,,- 走 - 我不能 我不能
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.75,0:48:11.88,Note,,0,0,0,,离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.85,0:48:14.57,Note,,0,0,0,,我不能 他们会杀了我的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.41,0:49:34.08,Note,,0,0,0,,没人看到什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.67,0:49:37.92,Note,,0,0,0,,- 我说了让你杀了那个混蛋 - 够了 维托
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.09,0:49:39.15,Note,,0,0,0,,是他干的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.34,0:49:42.92,Note,,0,0,0,,只有那个老混蛋会为了一个破相的婊子回来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.01,0:49:44.46,Note,,0,0,0,,我们会找到他然后杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.26,0:49:48.22,Note,,0,0,0,,我才不在乎他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.69,0:49:50.23,Note,,0,0,0,,这是你惹的乱子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.23,0:49:52.77,Note,,0,0,0,,你到底想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.44,0:49:58.02,Note,,0,0,0,,下次照我说的做 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.69,0:50:01.69,Note,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.11,0:50:07.24,Note,,0,0,0,,回去干活
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.13,0:53:59.68,Note,,0,0,0,,(美国边界 禁止穿越)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.34,0:56:03.47,Note,,0,0,0,,我想她
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.86,0:56:58.28,Note,,0,0,0,,我会哀痛一生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.90,0:57:01.11,Note,,0,0,0,,我感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.11,0:57:04.12,Note,,0,0,0,,我的心被挖出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.68,1:05:14.64,Note,,0,0,0,,(镁片)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.96,1:07:06.72,Note,,0,0,0,,警惕点 五个去畜棚 其余跟着我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.00,1:07:46.13,Note,,0,0,0,,查理 去看看 其余人跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.48,1:10:09.64,Note,,0,0,0,,(收录机)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.70,1:10:58.82,Note,,0,0,0,,(正面向敌)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.37,1:14:37.91,Note,,0,0,0,,你去死 还有你那婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,放松 放松 放松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好孩子 来 转弯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy. Come on. Turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住 孩子 稳住 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold, son. Hold, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来 孩子 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, son. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,转弯 转弯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn, turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,来 来 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buenos dias. - Buenos dias.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,睡得如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看到加布里的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see Gabri's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她打过电话 她很好 约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She called. She's fine, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她在安东尼娅家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's at Antonia's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我还希望她能帮我驯那匹白脸牡马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping she'd help me ride that new bald-faced stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她会喜欢那匹马的 它很擅长转弯 转弯好手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd like that horse. He turns great. Great turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她会是个好驯马师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she'd be a good trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她擅长和马匹相处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got a way with horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但她要去上大学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she is going to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为她想和你一样天天一股马味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think she wants to smell like horses all the time like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那么难闻吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不算难闻 如果你喜欢马的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, para nada, if you like horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take 'em down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不许出错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make no mistake about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我能向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assure you that, militarily,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这策略在军事上无法成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this strategy will not succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰叔叔 - 在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uncle John! - In here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你伺弄完马了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you finish working out the horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一把小刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A small knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这是大马士革钢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's Damascus steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你上大学准备的开信刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a letter opener I made for when you go away to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,再把白色把手嵌上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm gonna add on these white handles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,开信刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letter opener?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,放你桌子上会很好看的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be beautiful on your desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想扫你的兴 但现在没人写信了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to break it to you, but nobody writes letters anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那你可以用它赶走男孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you can use it to keep the boys away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 随便吧 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anyway. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有点疯狂 我要上大学了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's crazy. I'm about to start college.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么 我不知道我想做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know why. I have no idea what I want to do yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你像我这么大时知道自己想做什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know what you wanted to do at my age?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,知道 我想当兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I wanted to be a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这么大时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At my age?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,比你现在还小一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even before your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢当兵吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾有过毕生最好的几个朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I had some of the best friends I ever had for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你在这里问东问西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be real quiet around here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这里会变得特别安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without you asking all these questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你肯定能扛住 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sure you'll survive. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳要落山了 我只能再骑一小时了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun's setting. I only have about an hour left to ride, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 我得去安东尼娅家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why is that? - I have to go to Antonia's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她邀请秋天要去上大学的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's throwing this thing for the guys
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一起聚会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who are going to college in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.35,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不请他们来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you invite them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring them over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得上次他们来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what happened last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你把他们吓坏了 - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You freaked them out. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你一直瞪着他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you wouldn't stop staring at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.53,0:05:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我有时会那样 但不是故意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I do that sometimes, but it's not intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢邀请 但安东尼娅已经搞定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, but Antonia's got it covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在这里聚会 行吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just gonna have it there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们看看地道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们看看地道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你从不让别人进地道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't let anybody go in the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但他们是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but they're your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他们可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行 好 - 带他们看看地道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, cool. Yeah. - Yeah, show them the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那会很好玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that would be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我以后肯定会想念和你一起骑马的时光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really gonna miss riding with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会想念的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna miss riding with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很酷 他从不让别人下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this cool? He's never let anyone down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真疯狂 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我能适应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望她玩得开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope she's having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你从不让我进地道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never let me in the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你真想进的话 我可以带你转一圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you really wanna go in, I'll take you on a guided tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢 太脏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you. Too dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,确实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个聚会的好地方 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a great place for a party, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不行 好吗 我脑子里一堆事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not right now, okay? I have a lot on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你画的吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you draw that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是我十岁画的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drew that, actually, when I was ten years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,画得真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我得接这个电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,吉赛尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gizelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.31,0:07:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,妹子 你能听见吗 信号不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, girl, can you hear me? The reception is not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,能 能 我能听见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Yeah, yeah. I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,都告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:08:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加布里埃尔 - 怎么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gabrielle? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么 你朋友都走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing down here? All of your friends have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们搞得乱糟糟的 我在清理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made a big mess. I'm just cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,聚会怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone had a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一直问我为什么我叔叔挖了地道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They kept asking me why my uncle built these tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你喜欢挖掘 还有点疯癫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said that you like digging and you're a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.51,0:08:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,挺对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟你谈点事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能用开放的心态来看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I just want you to have an open mind about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去一趟墨西哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to go to Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么想去那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我找到了我爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I found my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友吉赛尔 她住在墨西哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend Gizelle, who lives there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她原来住这里 你记得她吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she used to live here. Do you remember her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我让她帮个忙 她找到了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked her for a favor, and she found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他住在她附近的一个镇里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lives in a town near hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰叔叔 我必须去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle John, I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要听他亲口说出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to hear it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.85,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要明白他为什么那么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to understand why he would just do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他不是好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he's not a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可能那么简单 - 就那么简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't be that simple. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰叔叔 我听过那些故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle John, I've heard the stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你经历过很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我的世界与你的完全不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my world is a lot different from yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 你的更可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not. It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,人不会无缘无故做坏事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People don't just act bad for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一个男人不管有什么理由都不能抛弃家庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no reason for a man to throw his family away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,能有个家庭就够幸运了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lucky he has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么生气 - 因为你不知道这个世界多坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you getting so mad? - Because you don't know how bad it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道人心能有多黑暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how black a man's heart can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上没有好人 加布里埃尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing good out there, Gabrielle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那种男人不会变 只会变得更坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men like that don't change. It only gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你就变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我没变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是努力控制住自己 日日如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to keep a lid on it, every day.
