Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.89,0:51:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你那时才十一岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember you were just about 11 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.39,0:51:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你一天赢了五场 真的很了不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won five events in one day. That's really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.50,0:51:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,加布里埃尔 别闭眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gabrielle, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.87,0:51:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你能行的 我们很快就到家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it. We're gonna be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.69,0:51:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会照顾好你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.92,0:51:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有漫长的人生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got so much life left.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.44,0:51:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有许多要做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got so many things you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.53,0:51:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,许多事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.13,0:52:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,很久之前我回家时 你那么小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I came home a long time ago, you were so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.34,0:52:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,加布里埃尔 你那么小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gabrielle, you were so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.69,0:52:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我很迷茫 我迷失了自我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was lost. I was a lost man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.64,0:52:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我见到了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.56,0:52:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了我以为再也看不到的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I saw something that I didn't think I'd ever see anymore:
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.55,0:52:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上的美好 纯真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good in this world. Some innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.47,0:52:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我有了一个从不敢奢望的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I had a family that I never thought I'd ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.92,0:52:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抚养你长大 是我这辈子最好的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And raising you, it was the best thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.23,0:52:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为此我谢谢你 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thank you for that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.65,0:52:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你就像...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like the...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.32,0:52:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,加布里埃尔 加布里埃尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gabrielle? Gabrielle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.74,0:52:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,加布里埃尔 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gabrielle. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.99,0:52:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.33,0:52:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,加布里埃尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gabrielle?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.23,0:53:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.06,0:53:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.92,0:53:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.22,0:54:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.49,0:56:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你住在你妹妹家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to stay at your sister's.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.06,0:56:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没什么让你留恋的了 我也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing for you here, nothing for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.59,0:56:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.34,0:56:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我四处漂泊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just gonna move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.75,0:56:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一如往常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.76,0:56:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我还会再见到你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.02,0:56:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.38,0:56:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想念这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will miss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.59,0:57:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.09,0:57:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一路顺风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.36,1:00:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.49,1:00:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.45,1:00:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.50,1:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有人看到你 我们两个都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If someone sees you, we both will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.67,1:00:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,回来这里太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming back here is so dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.33,1:00:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到她了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.67,1:00:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.22,1:00:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.97,1:01:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.30,1:01:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 我明白你的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really am. I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.89,1:01:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但回来真的很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But coming back was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.98,1:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.19,1:01:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我想找到那个瘦子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna find the thin one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.69,1:01:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 伤她那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - The one that cut her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.69,1:01:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 伤我那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - The one that cut me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.82,1:01:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not help you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.32,1:01:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.53,1:01:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.53,1:01:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这能改变什么 什么也改变不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will it change? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.58,1:01:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们悲痛然后继续生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We grieve and move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.63,1:01:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've done that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.71,1:01:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天都会想她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I think of her every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.80,1:01:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的每一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every fucking day.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.47,1:01:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们必须向前看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have to move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.68,1:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不能呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you can't move on?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.98,1:01:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果完全不能呢 - 可你必须那么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What if you can't move on at all? - But you have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:01:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别无选择 过去的已经过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no choice. What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.77,1:01:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it done?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.28,1:01:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it ever done?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.45,1:02:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到她那张纯真的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I look at something so innocent...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.12,1:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,永远地失去了生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I see that face never have life in it again,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.66,1:02:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how is it ever done?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.75,1:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我要复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.80,1:02:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他们知道死期到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want them to know that death is coming...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.72,1:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们做什么都无济于事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's nothing they can do to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.10,1:02:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他们感受到我们的悲痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want them to feel our grief...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.06,1:02:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,并且知道那是他们人生最后的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and know that's the last thing they will ever feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.99,1:02:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你也想这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know you want it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.91,1:04:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.22,1:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他 这个外国佬不算什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him! This old gringo is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.96,1:13:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.59,1:14:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.80,1:14:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.92,1:14:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我本可以杀你十次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could've killed you ten times.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.34,1:14:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想把你留到最后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wanted you last.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.01,1:14:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你去死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.60,1:14:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你去死 你死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, fuck you, dead man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.23,1:14:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要你在被我剖胸挖心时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to feel my rage, my hate,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.48,1:14:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,感受我的愤怒 我的仇恨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I reach into your chest and rip out your heart!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.61,1:14:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你对我做的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you did mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.91,1:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想活吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to live?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.87,1:14:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着灯光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow the lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.27,1:17:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what it feels like.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.54,1:18:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直活在死亡的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lived in a world of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.66,1:18:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾尝试回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to come home,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.17,1:18:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但从未真正回到家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I never really arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.67,1:18:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一部分精神和灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A part of my mind and soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.97,1:18:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在途中迷失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}got lost along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.51,1:18:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的心仍在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my heart was still here,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.27,1:18:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我出生的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.31,1:18:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会一直守护到死的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where I would defend to the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.11,1:18:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我仅有的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only family I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.82,1:18:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我仅有的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only home I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.16,1:18:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱的人现在都已逝去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the ones I've loved are now ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.16,1:18:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但我会拼命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I will fight...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.83,1:18:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们的记忆长存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep their memories alive...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.92,1:19:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,直到永远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forever.
